ion task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":288564,"global_rank":27968,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5681},{"name":"smfxfc/FighterFactBot","owner":"smfxfc","html_url":"https://github.com/smfxfc/FighterFactBot","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Reddit bot to deliver MMA fighter stats when called by a user. ","topics":[],"score":288562,"global_rank":27970,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5682},{"name":"Abhishek-1804/Leetcode","owner":"Abhishek-1804","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhishek-1804/Leetcode","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288556,"global_rank":27974,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5683},{"name":"spyoungtech/ahk-client","owner":"spyoungtech","html_url":"https://github.com/spyoungtech/ahk-client","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Client for ahk-server","topics":[],"score":288518,"global_rank":27984,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5684},{"name":"logankaser/ford_hackathon","owner":"logankaser","html_url":"https://github.com/logankaser/ford_hackathon","stars":6,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1